{
  "name": "dsh-completion-voice",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "DSH 插件：任务完成 / 需要你做选择 / 开始新对话时用语音播报（默认「已完成当前任务」、「老大老大，等你做选择呢」、按时间问候「早上好/中午好/下午好/晚上好！有什么工作需要做吗？」），左下角还有一个悬浮泡可以一键静音/恢复",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "notification",
    "tts",
    "voice"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/plugin.mjs",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zhangjie-2007/dsh-voice.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zhangjie-2007/dsh-voice#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/zhangjie-2007/dsh-voice/issues"
  },
